sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Agent as Chatting Agent
    participant Specs as /vista:specs (modified)
    participant FS as File System
    participant Git as Git

    User->>Agent: /vista:specs my-feature
    Agent->>Specs: invoke specs(my-feature)

    Specs->>FS: Read domain-requirements.md
    Specs->>FS: Read arch/_arch.json + *.mmd

    Specs->>Specs: Decompose into topics
    Specs->>User: Confirm topic list
    User->>Specs: Approved

    loop For each topic
        Specs->>Specs: Extract requirements from domain-requirements.md
        Specs->>Specs: Derive feature prefix (e.g., MF for my-feature)
        Specs->>Specs: Assign sequential IDs (MF-F1, MF-F2, MF-NF1...)
        Specs->>FS: Write specs/{topic}.md with:<br/>- Changelog (Created entry)<br/>- Requirement IDs on each req<br/>- Requirement Index table
    end

    Specs->>Git: git add specs/*.md
    Specs->>Git: git commit -m "spec(my-feature): initial spec generation with N topics"

    Specs-->>Agent: Report generated specs
    Agent-->>User: "Generated N specs with requirement IDs. Next: /vista:spec-update to modify."
